    {
     "id": "p019.s01",
     "source": "Outlook. —“This volume of Swedish fairy tales is marked with a great simplicity and a very real literary skill."
    },
    {
     "id": "p019.s02",
     "source": "All lovers of Fairy-lore will welcome the pretty stories, and will realise that in introducing us to ‘Jolly Calle,’ ‘Rolf of Orkanas’ and the ‘Bubbly-boy,’ they have introduced us to near friends."
    },
    {
     "id": "p019.s03",
     "source": "Some of them are glad, some very sad, but all charming."
    },
    {
     "id": "p019.s04",
     "source": "The illustrations are excellent.”"
    }
   ],
